    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Monomorphic epitheliotropic intestinal T-cell lymphoma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Neoplastic lymphocytes are medium-sized, showing regular, round to slightly irregular nuclei with slightly open chromatin and inconspicuous nucleoli. There are few admixed inflammatory cells.</p>",
