    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Monomorphic epitheliotropic intestinal T-cell lymphoma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>The lymphoma shows transmural infiltration of the small bowel wall, with ulceration but no necrosis.&nbsp;</p>",
